  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Deep dive on human rights and womens safety in tea in Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In this deep dive project, through comprehensive assessment and stakeholder engagement, Oxfam will help Unilever to understand the risks, actors, and activities they need to consider. Through the project, Oxfam&apos;s team of global leads and local experts will deliver a comprehensive assessment report, including: 1. Detailed analysis of women&apos;s safety in Indonesia&apos;s tea industry and identification of interconnected human rights risks, 2. Identification and mapping of key stakeholders in Indonesia&apos;s tea industry, and 3. Detailed mapping of existing activities related to women&apos;s safety and human rights in Indonesia, identification of gaps, and recommendations for mitigating the identified risks.</narrative>
  </description>
